            <description><![CDATA[<p><em>More accurate, more reliable, usable by more people.</em></p>
<h3>New</h3>
<ul><li>Support for Reduce Motion and VoiceOver</li><li>Breaks are recorded individually — like all data, only on your Mac</li></ul>
<h3>Improved</h3>
<ul><li>Breaks and the countdown now cover every display</li><li>The statistics window responds noticeably faster</li></ul>
<h3>Fixed</h3>
<ul><li>Focus blocks ran longer than configured under load</li><li>The timer kept running while the screen was locked</li></ul>
]]></description>
